+# Performance history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures for ingesting this project's own real Claude Code
+transcript (size in MB, turns produced, episodes produced, ingest duration)
+could be found in this repository or reproduced from within this working
+directory.
+
+What was checked:
+- `crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs` has a `parses_real_transcripts_when_present`
+  smoke test that reads real transcripts from
+  `~/.claude/projects/-home-ilien-Projects-muninn` when present, and prints
+  turn/episode/tool counts to stderr — but it does not measure or record wall
+  time, transcript size, or persist its output anywhere, and this session's
+  sandbox does not permit reading outside the current working directory to
+  run it against a real transcript.
+- `research/00-evidence-log.md`, `design/ENGINE.md`, and
+  `crates/muninn-bench/experiment/README.md` describe ingest design and
+  benchmark methodology but contain no recorded run figures for a real
+  transcript.
+- No `results.jsonl`, `summary.md`, or similar benchmark output exists
+  anywhere in the repository.
+
+If this measurement is taken in the future (e.g. by running the smoke test
+above or `muninn ingest` against a real transcript file and timing it),
+record the transcript's file size in MB, the turn and episode counts it
+produced, and the wall-clock ingest duration here.
